{
  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Policy Rule Modified, Deactivated or Deleted",
  "Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Defense Evasion / T1562\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Policy Rule Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\" or \"<ip>|Okta Policy Rule Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\"\n\nDetects Okta policy rules being modified, deactivated or deleted (policy.rule.update / deactivate / delete). Changing a rule (for example to drop an MFA requirement) can weaken a policy without touching the policy itself. Merges the separate modify, deactivate and delete rules.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_policy_rule_modified_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/?query=okta.yml",
  "Labels": [
    "okta",
    "detection",
    "admin-configuration-changes",
    "defense-evasion",
    "T1562"
  ],
  "Schedule": "7,22,37,52 * * * *",
  "Duration": -900,
  "DefaultDeploymentRules": {
    "Disabled": false,
    "RunImmediately": false
  },
